OL,3,APubs in England and Wales to allow
OL,4,Adigital ID apps to prove age
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlcohol buyers will be able to use a
OL,7,Fdigital ID app on their phones to prove
OL,8,Ftheir age under new rules introduced on
OL,9,FTuesday.
OL,11,FPubs and shops in England and Wales can
OL,12,Fuse the tech in addition to current
OL,13,Fphysical forms of ID - with the
OL,14,Fgovernment saying a digital option will
OL,15,Fmake age-checks quicker and more secure
OL,16,Ffor customers and staff.
OL,18,FCustomers will be able to choose ID
OL,19,Fapps from a range of suppliers such as
OL,20,Fthe Post Office, Yoti or Luciditi,
OL,21,Fprovided they are on a
OL,22,Fgovernment-approved list.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,113,105,200,160,0,100
